{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "093f49d87d0c15ceb8916f47e7649f09f0313fe7cf118ce312c52e3182faa134", "ja": "（明日はいよいよ、昴が初めて765プロライブ劇場に\n立つ日。その昴は……緊張してるみたいだな）", "zh": "（明天就是昴首次登上765艺能剧场舞台的日子。\n而昴她……似乎非常紧张。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6fb8a6313b263b995eeb681b45282b5b7c480cc58d45168e47709b2315f83527", "ja": "昴、大丈夫か？", "zh": "昴，你还好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "5dfb037c32176773a580b40aca1f20a05bf370e8cb032041b211ab4c34ecf02e", "ja": "{$P$}……オレ、ダメかもっ。\n初舞台だって思うと、すげー緊張して……。", "zh": "{$P$}……我可能不行了。\n一想到要首次登台，我就超紧张的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d3ec452ecd569eac500c8a9067ec5a970e34e9315be0456763b0b50e7349c21e", "ja": "そんなに緊張しなくて平気だ。\nこれまでのレッスンを信じて、頑張ろう。", "zh": "不用这么紧张没关系。\n要相信你之前做过的训练课程，加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "7b006c57ab086374587dc65632e27f4b7e6c193de3da00be1fc5a9b08edd8833", "ja": "そうは言うけどさ、『初試合』とか『初完封』とか\n『初勝利』とか、大事な記念だろ？", "zh": "是这么说没错，但像是『生涯首战』、『首场完封』、\n『首场胜投』等等，都是非常值得纪念的不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "86d4ea931b4ae707ab5f2f8ff05c379e9e2ac159dd74d15bbef9706e2b9cb31e", "ja": "それと同じで、『初舞台』ってなったら、\n緊張しない方が無理だって……。", "zh": "明天也一样，是我的『首次登台』，\n怎么可能不会紧张啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ffe4a2adf95e1d2bc26f3c6ddfba33d798d3f3e0e592e8c7c74ad8117289d311", "ja": "それはそうだけど……。", "zh": "这么说也没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "10cf4e6ed3c215cba99fcedd2eb8cda00db905c20b657b21415a257c5b9a59af", "ja": "あー。緊張しすぎて、夜も寝られなそう……。", "zh": "啊──好紧张哦，晚上可能睡不着了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4c342a9e3d448b4cae7fc7445623c3e7ba1cd30ee9e664900e146738f99a57c0", "ja": "そうか。なら、何か別のことをして、\n気を紛らわせるとかはどうだ？", "zh": "很紧张吗？\n那要不要做点其他事情来分散注意力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "34b5a7bd1d687bbe0dd5f81d340144bf01f4d21f20f939725eb6edeb3057e9f5", "ja": "別のこと？\nそうだなあ……。", "zh": "其他事情？\n我想一下喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "92751dd4935eebfa2e02df03a5b85907dee9c3aac084c6b399ad87520906a4a6", "ja": "うん！\nやっぱ思い浮かぶのは、野球かな！", "zh": "嗯！\n我最先想到的还是棒球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6cb4dbbd76b30d749dc3c2f5ce6fab5f4bf5a145ea583d0009cb5cea333fd9d8", "ja": "はは、相変わらずだな。\nまあ、さすがに野球は無理だけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，你就是这样。\n不过呢，不可能真的打棒球……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e6542fdebf1a4bdf5cc23a9505e855aafbb9d3750f030d522dc93877f751f241", "ja": "キャッチボールぐらいならできるか。\n一緒にやるか？", "zh": "但如果只是传接球应该没问题。\n我陪你吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "16d8bc4f3beb6ec738b238d6a13d7cd0ac3eccca69928c4408341eda1f95dbd4", "ja": "{$P$}、付き合ってくれるのか！？\nやった！　早く公園に行こうぜ！", "zh": "{$P$}，你要陪我传接球吗！？\n太好啦！我们快去公园吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "782448c75e9e2ff670e4783d346f3440faebe71e178f2fae027bd0dce1d5c614", "ja": "はぁー、楽しかった！\nおかげで頭もスッキリしたよ！", "zh": "呼──好开心啊！\n现在精神爽快多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ee501c12d89fbf48ab5493a3e997e1b66b3c16627cbf75231429377435933bb2", "ja": "はぁ……、はぁ……。す、すごい体力だな、昴。\nさっきリハーサルしたばかりだっていうのに……。", "zh": "呼……呼……你、你的体力还真旺盛，昴。\n明明才刚排练过而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "317e3dff926558cb2314c18d39f8b770a8ff6c3bad7eabd4b60a932af1b1efdb", "ja": "へへっ、野球は別腹ってヤツかな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，棒球用的体力要另外算啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "8d5a3018d27a51e9f3e8d7605083970cd6b09eb1bacc3b6744959ec9d2d2f8a4", "ja": "けどさ、体動かしたおかげで、\nぜーんぜん緊張しなくなったよ！", "zh": "不过，活动身体之后，\n我现在完～全不紧张啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_047sub_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_047sub_003_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "2f023e1f0f1928f35a974dd1629713c0e420893864a9a5aa8823877c47179e61", "ja": "これならきっと、\n明日はリラックスして初ステージに立てる！", "zh": "这样明天一定可以放松心情，\n站上我的第一个舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
